        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lucy Maud Montgomery, Jan Karon\n- Works: Anne of Green Gables, Anne of Avonlea, Anne of Avonlea (1975 film)\n- Roles: Canadian author, American novelist\n\nFacts:\n- Lucy Maud Montgomery was born on November 30, 1874, and died on April 24, 1942.\n- Lucy Maud Montgomery published under the name L.M. Montgomery.\n- In 1908, Lucy Maud Montgomery began a novel series with Anne of Green Gables.\n- Lucy Maud Montgomery was a Canadian author.\n- Jan Karon is an American novelist who writes for both adults and young readers.\n- Anne of Avonlea is the sequel to Anne of Green Gables by Lucy Maud Montgomery.\n- The 1975 film Anne of Avonlea is based on Anne of Avonlea by Lucy Maud Montgomery.",
